+    the think region of every round may only contain one or more [s, e] spans (at least one with s < e; after removing the spans only whitespace, commas or semicolons remain),
+    and the answer letter of the last round must be parsable with the single-turn parser. The thinking of the multi-turn SFT data also contains only spans."""
+    rounds = predict_str_list if isinstance(predict_str_list, list) else [predict_str_list]
